WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.655
Northstar: a complete pipeline with local CSV and Parquet data.

00:00:01.655 --> 00:00:09.211
Run the pipeline. DuckDB computes each step and its outputs.

00:00:09.211 --> 00:00:16.238
Select Regional revenue to inspect the report output.

00:00:16.238 --> 00:00:20.584
Click a revenue value to see the calculation and its contributions.

00:00:20.584 --> 00:00:24.226
The graph connects source amounts to the calculation, skipping unchanged values.

00:00:24.226 --> 00:00:37.418
Page through all contributing cells, five at a time.

00:00:37.418 --> 00:00:43.970
Open Code to inspect the SQL and project files behind the visual flow.

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:47.250
Your data, your logic, your workspace. Start with the Northstar tour.
